# Implementation Plan - Settings Modernization

The goal is to streamline the settings page, removing unused options and ensuring the remaining ones are fully functional and "modernized".

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] Settings UI - settings.html

#### [MODIFY] [settings.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.html)
- **General Tab**:
    - **Language**: Remove options other than English and French.
    - **Date Format**: Remove entirely.
    - **Timezone**: Ensure the dropdown has a comprehensive list of major timezones.
- **Reporting Tab**:
    - **GWP**: Remove options other than SAR and AR4.
    - **Units & Currency**: Remove entirely.
- **Notifications Tab**:
    - Remove "Email Notifications" toggle if present (or anything explicitly labeled as such).
    - Ensure styling is consistent with the glassmorphism theme.
- **Save Actions**: Ensure buttons are clearly visible and wired to [settings.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.js).

### [Component Name] Settings Logic - settings.js

#### [MODIFY] [settings.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.js)
- **Modifications**:
    - Remove logic related to deleted fields (date format, currency, units).
    - Update [saveNotificationSettings](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/settings.js#53-64) to trigger a toast message.
    - **Notification Logic**: Ensure that enabling "Weekly Emissions", "Target Exceedance", or "New Audit Log" actually enables these checks in the system.
    - **Verification**: Trigger a test notification (or ensure the logic is active) when these are enabled to confirm they appear in the notification bell.

### [Component Name] Dashboard - dashboard.js & notification-logic.js

#### [MODIFY] [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.js)
- Use `Intl.DateTimeFormat` with the stored `ghg_timezone` to display the "Last Updated" time correctly.
- Integrate with [notification-logic.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/notification-logic.js) to check settings before generating alerts.

#### [MODIFY] [notification-logic.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/notification-logic.js)
- Check `ghg_notif_weekly`, `ghg_notif_targets`, and `ghg_notif_audit` flags before adding notifications.
- Implement logic to generate these specific notifications if the criteria are met (e.g., Target Exceeded).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Settings Page**:
    - Verify only EN/FR languages are shown.
    - Verify Date Format/Currency/Units are gone.
    - Verify GWP only shows SAR/AR4.
    - Verify Timezone selection saves correctly.
    - Verify Save buttons show a successful toast message.
- **Dashboard**:
    - Change timezone in settings (e.g., to Tokyo), go to dashboard, verify the "Last Updated" time reflects the new timezone.
    - **Notifications**:
        - Enable "Target Exceedance Alerts", set a low target, and verify a "Target Exceeded" alert appears in the bell.
        - Enable "New Audit Log Entry", perform a sensitive action (like changing Base Year), and verify an "Audit" alert appears in the bell.
        - Enable "Weekly Summary", verify a summary notification appears on load (simulation).
